 twentyVsFifty: '<strong>The apparent "United 20 MW versus 50 MW" conflict is not a conflict.</strong> 20 MW is United\u2019s RACKING scope - its 497 rows in Zone F carry 35,308 modules, which is 21.0 MW. 50 MW is its MODULE scope, which covers the whole East side including rows that ECCS and Workforce build. Module installation is independent of who racks the row.',
